<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 1.35 bln.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 1.35 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction November 26 versus November 19  SUVK :</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days    78/85	351/358</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.01/3.01   3.36/3.38</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.01/3.01   3.38/3.38</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.00/3.01   3.35/3.38</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million  331/500   1,020/500</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    331/2,436 1,020/920</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.5 billion markka. After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 38,101 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
